WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.840
Episode 14

01:37.860 --> 01:40.560
Someone asked me to kill you when nobody is around,

01:40.900 --> 01:42.450
but I don't like it.

01:42.900 --> 01:44.430
You're so cruel as to kill people in broad daylight.
=Cheng Jushu, Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master of Beiqi=

01:44.450 --> 01:47.110
What you did is unforgivable.

01:47.130 --> 01:48.620
I'll kill you

01:48.620 --> 01:50.810
in public!

01:51.220 --> 01:53.640
Someone wants to do business with you,

01:54.050 --> 01:55.640
but I don't.

01:56.500 --> 01:58.770
They don't kill you for overall interests.

01:58.860 --> 02:00.370
Let me do it!

02:00.580 --> 02:01.880
Delay Fan Xian.

02:01.900 --> 02:03.480
Follow me! Go!

02:03.500 --> 02:04.640
Go!

02:07.650 --> 02:09.040
I've made much progress

02:09.060 --> 02:10.890
since my last battle with you.

02:11.370 --> 02:13.450
You'll certainly die today!

02:16.260 --> 02:18.560
Call for help! Stop Fan Xian!

02:22.140 --> 02:23.630
If there's no one

02:23.650 --> 02:24.450
you're willing to die for

02:24.450 --> 02:25.800
in this world,

02:25.820 --> 02:27.550
how boring it will be!

02:27.570 --> 02:28.970
I understand.

02:29.140 --> 02:30.350
Only with someone like that

02:30.370 --> 02:31.010
can we really

02:31.010 --> 02:32.730
take roots in this world.

02:38.570 --> 02:39.490
In public?

02:39.490 --> 02:39.980
Yes.

02:39.980 --> 02:41.190
Most of our men are waiting

02:41.210 --> 02:42.450
in the forest out of town

02:42.450 --> 02:44.010
on your instructions.

02:44.010 --> 02:44.780
-So, we can't... -Okay.

02:44.780 --> 02:46.120
I'll go there myself.

02:57.820 --> 02:58.970
Don't come over.

02:59.260 --> 03:00.810
It's horrible.

03:06.090 --> 03:07.710
This is Teng Zijing's dagger.

03:07.730 --> 03:09.920
You should remember the name.

03:25.650 --> 03:26.920
Big guy.

03:35.210 --> 03:36.600
I'm looking for you.

03:36.620 --> 03:38.610
You don't live in the box now?

03:38.700 --> 03:40.170
Stop there.

03:40.900 --> 03:42.330
Uncle Fan.

03:46.260 --> 03:47.480
Stop it.

03:47.540 --> 03:49.120
What happened to your head?

03:52.420 --> 03:53.830
Don't hurt him.

03:53.850 --> 03:55.560
I can let you go.

04:02.780 --> 04:04.090
Stop it!

04:09.700 --> 04:11.120
Turn around!

04:18.610 --> 04:19.890
Do you know the big guy

04:19.890 --> 04:21.200
who live in the box?

04:22.090 --> 04:24.320
You might've had a chance

04:24.700 --> 04:26.480
if you had hijacked him.

04:26.700 --> 04:29.440
Since I was born,

04:29.580 --> 04:31.470
people have been frightened or disgusted

04:31.490 --> 04:35.810
when they see me.

04:36.930 --> 04:39.410
They beg me to kill other people

04:39.770 --> 04:42.370
or stay away from me.

04:42.740 --> 04:45.640
He's the only one

04:46.610 --> 04:49.410
who'd treat me on fruit.

04:55.050 --> 04:55.700
Yeah.

04:55.700 --> 04:58.560
He's like a kid when he eats a pear.

04:58.580 --> 04:59.720
Oh. Uncle Fan,

04:59.740 --> 05:01.530
do you know where my dad is?

05:02.090 --> 05:03.320
Catch him!

05:06.300 --> 05:08.440
Walk forward. Don't look back.

05:09.140 --> 05:10.410
Walk straight on.

05:11.650 --> 05:12.970
Go home.

05:25.540 --> 05:26.920
Walk straight on!

05:37.020 --> 05:39.370
Do you know what you've done?

05:39.650 --> 05:41.480
I just enforced justice on behalf of Heaven.

05:41.580 --> 05:44.560
You idiot. You ruined our plan!

05:44.580 --> 05:46.000
Hold back your anger.

05:46.020 --> 05:47.310
How about having some bitter gourd?

05:47.330 --> 05:49.150
The Investigator's Office never tolerates anyone

05:49.170 --> 05:50.820
that disobey orders.

05:50.820 --> 05:53.140
I didn't. I have the same seniority as you.

05:53.140 --> 05:54.630
Not anymore!

05:54.650 --> 05:56.470
What are you doing? Mr. Fei gave it to me.

05:56.490 --> 05:57.750
If he is here,

05:57.770 --> 05:58.490
I'll blame him

05:58.490 --> 06:00.070
for hiring the wrong person.

06:00.090 --> 06:01.750
Well, Your Excellency,

06:01.770 --> 06:03.350
are you so powerful

06:03.370 --> 06:04.860
as to blame your peers

06:04.860 --> 06:06.240
in the Investigator's Office?

06:06.260 --> 06:07.840
Fan Xian,

06:07.860 --> 06:09.650
you destroyed

06:09.650 --> 06:12.010
your promising future today.

06:12.890 --> 06:13.930
Shall I say sorry to you?

06:13.930 --> 06:15.150
Will it make you feel better?

06:15.170 --> 06:17.040
Take him to the dungeon.

06:18.170 --> 06:19.770
How is the food there?

06:19.770 --> 06:20.870
I don't like spicy food.

06:20.890 --> 06:22.530
I need soup every day.

06:29.260 --> 06:30.960
Was Cheng Jushu really killed?

06:30.980 --> 06:32.280
Yes, it's true.

06:32.300 --> 06:34.440
Fan Xian has been arrested by the Investigator's Office.

06:34.460 --> 06:35.470
How did he do that?

06:35.490 --> 06:38.910
He's so arrogant

06:38.930 --> 06:41.090
that he didn't wait to do it out of town.

06:41.140 --> 06:43.090
He fought and killed Cheng Jushu

06:43.090 --> 06:44.700
just at the gate of the Investigator's Office

06:44.700 --> 06:46.690
under the watchful eyes of people.

06:46.740 --> 06:47.890
Numerous pedestrians

06:47.890 --> 06:49.240
have witnessed it.

06:49.260 --> 06:51.310
He's really a hot-blooded young man.

06:51.330 --> 06:52.960
It seems impossible

06:52.980 --> 06:55.190
to hide the news.

06:55.210 --> 06:57.480
He's not just hot-blooded.

06:59.140 --> 07:02.130
He's made a correct assessment of the situation.

07:03.260 --> 07:06.680
He killed a guy in broad daylight and didn't try to hide it.

07:06.700 --> 07:08.870
Can we really say he's made a correct assessment?

07:08.890 --> 07:10.530
Yes.

07:10.890 --> 07:12.850
He did a good job.

07:17.050 --> 07:18.250
Prepare an imperial decree.

07:26.020 --> 07:27.520
Your Excellency.

07:27.540 --> 07:29.760
Your Excellency.

07:42.090 --> 07:43.320
What's up?

07:43.420 --> 07:45.870
Do you want to rebel?

07:45.890 --> 07:47.590
How dare we do that?

07:47.610 --> 07:50.030
Master Fei asked us to

07:50.050 --> 07:51.280
take good care of Young Master Fan

07:51.300 --> 07:53.030
before he left.

07:53.050 --> 07:54.610
Fei Jie is not in the capital city.

07:54.610 --> 07:55.860
No matter he's here or not,

07:55.860 --> 07:56.770
the Third Division

07:56.770 --> 07:58.520
will do as he said, right?

07:58.540 --> 08:00.350
Young Master Fan, don't worry.

08:00.370 --> 08:02.560
You're a disciple of Mr. Fei,

08:02.580 --> 08:04.470
so all of us will treat you as our junior fellow apprentice.

08:04.490 --> 08:06.810
Don't be afraid now that we're here.

08:08.050 --> 08:09.440
Hi, everyone.

08:09.820 --> 08:12.160
Hi, junior.

08:12.610 --> 08:14.750
He's really handsome and highly esteemed.

08:14.770 --> 08:15.680
Enough.

08:15.700 --> 08:17.630
Leng is the acting director

08:17.650 --> 08:18.720
of the Third Division, right?

08:18.740 --> 08:19.800
Ask him to come and see me.

08:19.820 --> 08:22.040
Sorry, Your Excellency.

08:22.090 --> 08:22.960
He developed

08:22.980 --> 08:24.000
a new kind of poison the other day.

08:24.020 --> 08:25.120
He can't move

08:25.140 --> 08:26.770
after taking some of it.

08:26.770 --> 08:28.460
However, he also asked us

08:28.460 --> 08:30.070
to protect Young Master Fan.

08:30.090 --> 08:31.240
He tried the poison himself?

08:31.260 --> 08:31.970
Let me tell you.

08:31.970 --> 08:33.470
It's a tradition of the Third Division.

08:33.490 --> 08:34.590
Leng is

08:34.610 --> 08:36.260
also one of Master Fei's disciples.

08:36.260 --> 08:37.490
He can be considered as our senior fellow apprentice.

08:37.490 --> 08:38.320
I have to see him.

08:38.340 --> 08:39.350
Definitely.

08:39.370 --> 08:41.320
However, it's a little serious this time.

08:41.340 --> 08:42.710
It may take him 10 to 15 days to recover.

08:42.730 --> 08:43.680
You have to wait.

08:43.700 --> 08:45.150
He's awesome.

08:45.170 --> 08:46.450
Exactly.

08:46.820 --> 08:48.520
So who can tell me

08:48.700 --> 08:50.890
what are you going to do to protect him?

08:51.100 --> 08:53.590
Your Excellency, he doesn't
have to be put into the dungeon

08:53.610 --> 08:55.760
no matter what he did, right?

08:55.780 --> 08:56.960
Okay.

08:57.290 --> 08:58.150
I'm taking him

08:58.170 --> 09:00.470
to the dungeon myself.

09:00.490 --> 09:03.270
Anyone who tries to stop me will be considered a rebel,

09:03.290 --> 09:06.400
whose family will get into trouble.

09:08.260 --> 09:10.130
Don't try to scare us.

09:13.490 --> 09:14.440
Step aside!

09:14.460 --> 09:15.390
Get ready!

09:15.410 --> 09:16.770
Hold on.

09:22.220 --> 09:24.320
It's a minor matter. I'll take care of it.

09:24.340 --> 09:25.270
Are you sure?

09:25.290 --> 09:26.570
Trust me.

09:47.970 --> 09:49.590
Now that Fan Jie is not in the capital city,

09:49.610 --> 09:50.880
the Third Division could do nothing

09:50.900 --> 09:52.200
without a leader.

09:52.220 --> 09:54.210
I'm much obliged to them.

09:54.290 --> 09:55.570
Fan Xian,

09:55.660 --> 09:57.590
you ruined our plan to attack Beiqi.

09:57.610 --> 09:59.200
Nobody can save you.

09:59.220 --> 10:00.580
Have you thought of it

10:00.580 --> 10:02.720
when you killed Cheng Jushu?

10:03.930 --> 10:05.440
Your Excellency, hold on.

10:05.460 --> 10:06.650
Wait.

10:06.850 --> 10:07.710
What?

10:07.730 --> 10:10.080
Even a clerk dares to stop me?

10:10.340 --> 10:11.840
Don't get me wrong.

10:11.970 --> 10:13.730
How could I dare to do that?

10:13.730 --> 10:15.890
I'll never stop you.

10:17.700 --> 10:18.910
Step aside.

10:18.930 --> 10:20.390
Hold on.

10:20.410 --> 10:22.720
Believe it or not. I'll fire you!

10:23.820 --> 10:24.800
Your Excellency,

10:24.820 --> 10:27.810
Fan Xian did something good to Nanqing!

10:28.100 --> 10:29.830
Are you crazy?

10:29.850 --> 10:31.210
Your Excellency,

10:31.490 --> 10:33.680
could you tell me which general of Beiqi

10:33.700 --> 10:35.780
wants to exchange their military plan

10:35.780 --> 10:37.100
for Cheng Jushu?

10:37.100 --> 10:39.520
It's none of your business!

10:42.580 --> 10:44.080
Your Excellency, please check this.

10:44.900 --> 10:46.030
What's this?

10:46.050 --> 10:47.760
It's a file

10:47.780 --> 10:49.680
on Cheng Jushu's life.

10:49.700 --> 10:51.680
What on earth do you want to say?

10:51.700 --> 10:54.200
I've read it carefully.

10:54.220 --> 10:56.410
Cheng Jushu is unsociable and eccentric.

10:56.410 --> 10:57.610
He's obstinate and unruly.

10:57.610 --> 10:58.530
He doesn't have any friend

10:58.530 --> 11:00.600
who serves in the army.

11:00.900 --> 11:02.080
Besides,

11:02.100 --> 11:03.640
most of the high-ranking military officers

11:03.660 --> 11:04.830
of Beiqi at the border

11:04.850 --> 11:06.710
think poorly of him

11:06.730 --> 11:08.800
and even hold grudges against him.

11:08.820 --> 11:10.510
In this case,

11:10.530 --> 11:12.240
who would want

11:12.260 --> 11:13.950
to exchange their military plan

11:13.970 --> 11:17.160
for Cheng Jushu's life?

11:21.220 --> 11:23.040
They aim to give you false information

11:23.220 --> 11:25.150
in the name of saving Cheng Jushu.

11:25.170 --> 11:27.470
Your Excellency Fan, you're really clever.

11:27.490 --> 11:30.570
I agree with you.

11:30.820 --> 11:33.510
They want to take this opportunity

11:33.530 --> 11:35.560
to send us false information.

11:35.580 --> 11:36.350
Once we go to war,

11:36.370 --> 11:37.530
such disinformation

11:37.530 --> 11:40.680
will make us fall into deadly traps.

11:40.700 --> 11:41.830
So,

11:41.850 --> 11:43.900
by killing Cheng Jushu,

11:43.900 --> 11:45.680
His Excellency Fan did a good job

11:45.700 --> 11:48.770
instead of making a mistake.

11:50.260 --> 11:53.330
Your Excellency, did you hear that?

11:58.930 --> 12:00.910
Your Excellency,

12:00.930 --> 12:04.120
His Excellency Fan set things right accidentally

12:04.140 --> 12:06.150
by doing that.

12:06.170 --> 12:09.840
Please give him a lesser punishment.

12:12.580 --> 12:13.890
Wang Qinian,

12:14.460 --> 12:16.120
you've spared no effort

12:16.140 --> 12:18.450
to save Fan Xian.

12:18.970 --> 12:20.760
That's a strong word.

12:20.780 --> 12:23.560
I'm taking the matter on its merits.

12:23.580 --> 12:25.390
Do you think you're the only one

12:25.410 --> 12:27.570
who has noticed that?

12:30.930 --> 12:33.760
It's a war of nations. We all know its importance.

12:33.780 --> 12:34.780
How could I not find out

12:34.780 --> 12:37.330
Cheng Jushu's background?

12:37.410 --> 12:37.820
So...

12:37.820 --> 12:39.390
Answer me.

12:39.410 --> 12:41.340
Why do you think

12:41.340 --> 12:42.970
I want to exchange Cheng Jushu's life

12:42.970 --> 12:45.080
for that disinformation?

12:50.170 --> 12:53.710
Did you turn their trick to our own use?

12:53.730 --> 12:55.910
You want to make them believe

12:55.930 --> 12:56.800
we've taken the bait?

12:56.820 --> 12:58.830
By then we'd know

12:58.850 --> 13:01.270
everything about them clearly.

13:01.290 --> 13:02.760
It'd be easy to defeat them.

13:02.780 --> 13:04.580
But Fan Xian killed Cheng Jushu.

13:04.580 --> 13:06.370
He's destroyed our plan!

13:06.370 --> 13:07.020
He... He...

13:07.020 --> 13:10.680
It's understandable, anyway.

13:10.700 --> 13:13.840
Since when could the
Investigator's Office stand such a matter?

13:18.100 --> 13:20.640
Fan Xian, have a guess.

13:20.660 --> 13:23.280
Who else would try to save you?

13:25.820 --> 13:27.390
I'm a people person.

13:27.410 --> 13:28.810
I can't guess it.

13:30.820 --> 13:33.030
Head is not in the capital city.

13:33.050 --> 13:35.150
Nobody can save you.

13:35.170 --> 13:36.030
Take him away!

13:36.050 --> 13:37.250
Wait.

13:37.610 --> 13:38.890
Hold on.

13:45.460 --> 13:47.400
Yan Ruohai?

13:53.000 --> 13:56.110
=Yan Ruohai, director of the Fourth Division
of the Investigator's Office=

14:29.260 --> 14:30.950
I've thought of many people,

14:30.970 --> 14:33.130
but I didn't expect it'd be you.

14:33.580 --> 14:35.160
Who is he?

14:35.340 --> 14:36.810
You don't know him?

14:38.050 --> 14:39.880
The Investigator's Office is divided into eight divisions.

14:39.900 --> 14:41.880
This is His Excellency Yan Ruohai,
director of the Fourth Division

14:41.900 --> 14:44.200
that's responsible for supervising
officials outside the capital city

14:44.220 --> 14:47.270
and carrying on

14:47.290 --> 14:49.040
secret investigations.

14:49.580 --> 14:52.130
The name sounds familiar to me.

14:53.660 --> 14:54.920
I'm seeing someone off.

14:55.340 --> 14:56.950
The one sitting in the carriage?

14:56.970 --> 14:58.200
It's Yan Ruohai's son,

14:58.220 --> 14:59.390
Yan Bingyun.

14:59.410 --> 15:01.910
How can you send an excellent
young man to an enemy country?

15:01.930 --> 15:03.560
It's all because of you.

15:03.580 --> 15:05.010
Because of me?

15:05.460 --> 15:07.460
Teng Zijing is a scout of the Fourth Division.

15:07.460 --> 15:08.760
A member of the Fourth Division

15:08.780 --> 15:10.830
actually tried to kill his superior.

15:10.850 --> 15:11.490
Yan Ruohai

15:11.490 --> 15:13.590
must take the responsibility.

15:13.610 --> 15:15.850
Teng Zijing is under the command of

15:15.850 --> 15:17.470
his son Yan Bingyun.

15:17.490 --> 15:18.590
The Head was so angry that

15:18.610 --> 15:20.240
he dismissed him from his post,

15:20.260 --> 15:23.330
The Fourth Division is in charge of detection and patrol.

15:23.580 --> 15:25.350
The Sixth Division is the division
responsible for assassination.

15:25.370 --> 15:26.850
Whoever wants to kill you

15:26.850 --> 15:27.760
didn't try hard enough.

15:27.780 --> 15:29.640
The fake order wasn't given to the Sixth Division,

15:29.660 --> 15:31.050
so the scout of the Fourth Division

15:31.050 --> 15:31.760
took action.

15:31.780 --> 15:33.100
If someone from the Sixth Division took the order,

15:33.100 --> 15:34.890
then you were in real trouble.

15:36.170 --> 15:36.850
I didn't know

15:36.850 --> 15:38.450
there are so many stories behind.

15:42.850 --> 15:46.210
My son was demoted and left
the capital city because of you.

15:46.850 --> 15:48.810
Yan Bingyun is your son.

15:53.290 --> 15:54.570
Let him go.

15:58.020 --> 15:59.930
Bingyun lurks in the capital of Beiqi

15:59.930 --> 16:01.030
and may be killed at any time.

16:01.050 --> 16:02.440
It's all his fault.

16:02.460 --> 16:03.440
I know.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.210
Why did you help him?

16:05.820 --> 16:07.720
I'm just here to pass on a message.

16:07.900 --> 16:09.470
Head is not in the capital city.

16:09.490 --> 16:11.250
From whom is the message?

16:26.700 --> 16:28.570
It's an imperial decree.

16:31.820 --> 16:34.450
Aren't you going to kneel down?

16:35.140 --> 16:36.840
I'm listening with respectful attention.

16:39.530 --> 16:42.010
Wang Qinian, what's going on?

16:42.170 --> 16:43.170
Kneel down.

16:43.170 --> 16:43.850
I can't.

16:43.850 --> 16:45.720
I'm tied up.

16:46.460 --> 16:47.260
Your Excellency.

16:47.260 --> 16:48.480
Stop it!

16:54.660 --> 16:56.590
Forget about it. I don't want to read it.

16:56.610 --> 16:57.800
Look at it yourself.

16:57.820 --> 16:59.120
It's simple.

16:59.140 --> 17:00.810
His Majesty asked you to let Fan Xian go.

17:01.020 --> 17:02.450
I will obey the order.

17:10.860 --> 17:12.080
Guards.

17:12.290 --> 17:13.650
Untie the ropes.

17:20.460 --> 17:22.080
Return the token to him.

17:29.290 --> 17:30.560
You're free to go.

17:30.770 --> 17:31.800
Thank you, Your Excellency.

17:31.820 --> 17:33.560
Even if those things hadn't happened to my son,

17:33.820 --> 17:35.800
I don't like you

17:35.820 --> 17:37.650
because of your casual attitude.

17:38.580 --> 17:40.250
I helped to save you,

17:40.530 --> 17:42.200
but I still look down upon you.

17:42.290 --> 17:45.010
So, don't thank me. Go home.

17:54.820 --> 17:56.410
Wang Qinian,

17:56.700 --> 17:58.170
walk me home.

18:00.220 --> 18:02.010
I have the same seniority as him.

18:04.170 --> 18:07.290
Your Excellencies,

18:07.500 --> 18:10.200
let me drive His Excellency Fan away.

18:12.500 --> 18:13.770
Go!

18:13.860 --> 18:15.800
Your Excellency, see you around.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.600
Your Excellency.

18:37.050 --> 18:38.230
Your Excellency,

18:38.250 --> 18:39.510
tell me

18:39.530 --> 18:40.910
how you made His Excellency Yan Ruohai

18:40.930 --> 18:42.800
your friend from your enemy.

18:42.820 --> 18:44.410
I didn't know him.

18:44.930 --> 18:47.600
Do you know His Majesty?

18:47.620 --> 18:49.080
What do you think?

18:50.170 --> 18:52.010
Then I'm confused.

18:52.170 --> 18:53.930
You killed Cheng Jushu

18:53.930 --> 18:55.130
at the gate of the Investigator's Office,

18:55.130 --> 18:57.630
but His Majesty ordered them to set you free.

18:57.650 --> 18:58.930
Why?

18:59.250 --> 19:01.080
Because I did it in public.

19:01.410 --> 19:02.840
What?

19:03.530 --> 19:05.410
If I killed Cheng Jushu in secret,

19:05.410 --> 19:06.990
I'd be punished.

19:07.010 --> 19:08.800
On the contrary,

19:09.170 --> 19:10.930
I'd be safe since I did it in public.

19:11.650 --> 19:12.930
Why?

19:14.340 --> 19:16.050
Four words.

19:19.620 --> 19:21.200
People will talk.

19:21.250 --> 19:24.200
That's why His Majesty did that.

19:24.530 --> 19:25.840
Everyone is talking about the assassination attempt

19:25.860 --> 19:27.600
that was carried out yesterday.

19:27.620 --> 19:28.820
Today, Fan Xian

19:28.820 --> 19:31.080
killed Cheng Jushu in public.

19:31.250 --> 19:32.750
Everyone knows that

19:32.770 --> 19:34.200
he did it to take revenge.

19:34.220 --> 19:36.010
So what?

19:36.100 --> 19:38.320
Cheng Jushu is a martial arts master from Beiqi.

19:39.250 --> 19:40.360
Your Excellency,

19:40.380 --> 19:41.870
Nanqing

19:41.890 --> 19:43.800
is the world's leading power.

19:43.820 --> 19:45.720
People here are always proud and confident.

19:46.340 --> 19:49.150
Now, a gifted scholar in Nanqing killed

19:49.170 --> 19:50.960
a martial arts master from Beiqi.

19:50.980 --> 19:53.770
Isn't it a story passed on with approval?

19:55.530 --> 19:57.560
What will the common people think

19:57.580 --> 19:59.130
if we put Fan Xian into prison?

20:02.100 --> 20:03.600
But

20:03.820 --> 20:06.390
he broke the law anyway.

20:06.410 --> 20:09.360
The war will begin soon. It's important to
win support from the common people.

20:09.380 --> 20:11.720
What His Majesty wants to protect

20:11.740 --> 20:13.360
is not Fan Xian

20:13.380 --> 20:14.800
but people's determination to win

20:14.820 --> 20:16.650
and their fighting will.

20:19.930 --> 20:21.600
I see.

20:21.620 --> 20:23.700
That's why you wanted to kill Cheng Jushu

20:23.700 --> 20:25.080
in broad daylight.

20:25.100 --> 20:26.340
When I did that,

20:26.340 --> 20:27.720
I just wanted to take revenge.

20:27.740 --> 20:28.740
I didn't figure out the whole thing

20:28.740 --> 20:30.680
until it all had happened.

20:30.700 --> 20:31.620
It means

20:31.620 --> 20:33.500
Heaven rewards the good.

20:33.500 --> 20:35.340
What you did conforms to the will of Heaven,

20:35.340 --> 20:36.560
so you turned ill luck into good.

20:36.580 --> 20:37.770
Wang,

20:38.250 --> 20:39.630
do me another favor.

20:39.650 --> 20:41.800
You've already killed him.

20:41.820 --> 20:43.110
I haven't found the one behind the scenes.

20:43.130 --> 20:44.390
It's not over yet.

20:44.410 --> 20:46.200
But Cheng Jushu is dead.

20:46.220 --> 20:47.600
There were also two female assassinators.

20:47.620 --> 20:48.270
They're dead too.

20:48.290 --> 20:49.200
It doesn't matter.

20:49.220 --> 20:50.360
Find out their background.

20:50.380 --> 20:51.480
Your Excellency,

20:51.820 --> 20:54.600
it's confidential. I don't have the right to...

20:58.010 --> 20:59.080
Fine.

20:59.100 --> 21:01.320
For truth and justice,

21:01.340 --> 21:03.480
it's my bounden duty.

21:05.720 --> 21:09.230
=Capital City=

22:30.380 --> 22:32.510
Fan Xian knows clearly

22:32.530 --> 22:34.440
the one behind the assassination
attempt is extremely powerful

22:34.460 --> 22:37.170
now that it even dared to do it in public.

22:37.340 --> 22:39.130
This is just the beginning.

22:39.250 --> 22:40.600
The road ahead

22:40.620 --> 22:43.080
will be full of hazards.

23:19.010 --> 23:20.700
Uncle! Uncle!

23:20.700 --> 23:22.370
Why are you here?

23:29.740 --> 23:31.980
Uncle, how is it going

23:31.980 --> 23:32.930
with that big guy?

23:32.930 --> 23:33.740
Why did you

23:33.740 --> 23:35.560
fight him?

23:37.890 --> 23:39.150
Where did you see him?

23:39.170 --> 23:40.560
In a courtyard.

23:40.580 --> 23:41.230
At that time,

23:41.250 --> 23:43.600
he lived in a box.

23:43.930 --> 23:45.030
Do you remember

23:45.050 --> 23:46.150
where it is?

23:46.170 --> 23:47.680
Yeah.

23:48.410 --> 23:49.840
Can you tell me about it?

23:50.250 --> 23:51.030
The courtyard is beside the stable

23:51.050 --> 23:53.250
on Dashu Street.

23:55.380 --> 23:56.230
Uncle.

23:56.250 --> 23:57.720
I'll take you to my mom.

23:57.740 --> 23:59.130
Mom!

23:59.130 --> 24:01.840
Uncle Fan is here.

24:01.860 --> 24:03.410
Open the door.

24:06.500 --> 24:07.840
Mrs. Teng.

24:15.340 --> 24:16.890
Go to play.

24:18.740 --> 24:20.200
Come in.

24:28.410 --> 24:29.410
My son said

24:29.410 --> 24:31.680
he saw you fight a guy on the street.

24:34.220 --> 24:35.930
He's called Cheng Jushu,

24:36.890 --> 24:38.600
an Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master of Beiqi.

24:39.860 --> 24:42.370
He was injured and had difficulty in moving,

24:42.650 --> 24:44.480
or I couldn't be a match for him.

24:45.650 --> 24:46.720
I...

24:46.740 --> 24:48.320
I killed him

24:48.740 --> 24:50.840
without letting your son seeing it.

24:53.580 --> 24:54.930
I...

24:56.980 --> 24:58.800
I killed him because...

25:10.860 --> 25:12.680
Yesterday afternoon,

25:13.980 --> 25:15.840
Zijing and I

25:16.530 --> 25:19.440
were attacked

25:22.220 --> 25:24.480
on Niulan Street.

25:25.410 --> 25:26.890
I...

25:37.050 --> 25:39.650
I lit the lamp last night.

25:40.170 --> 25:42.960
He said something to me

25:43.740 --> 25:46.080
after he decided to stay in the capital city.

25:56.340 --> 25:58.080
I don't want to stay overnight in the capital city.

25:58.100 --> 26:00.230
I'll come back every night.

26:00.250 --> 26:02.290
Remember to leave a lamp on for me.

26:02.980 --> 26:04.410
The lamp will be always on

26:05.290 --> 26:06.800
till you come back.

26:08.100 --> 26:11.560
Crises occur here and there in the capital city.

26:11.930 --> 26:14.680
I may get into trouble anytime since I stay with Mr. Fan.

26:15.410 --> 26:16.930
Maybe,

26:17.580 --> 26:20.960
I can't come back someday.

26:30.050 --> 26:34.360
Mr. Fan, how is it going with him?

26:34.380 --> 26:35.770
Zijing...

26:42.050 --> 26:43.560
...was killed.

26:48.170 --> 26:49.320
Mrs. Teng.

26:49.340 --> 26:50.930
Don't touch me!

27:03.890 --> 27:06.290
Where is his body?

27:07.250 --> 27:08.800
Just outside.

27:17.220 --> 27:18.960
He couldn't have died

27:19.770 --> 27:21.440
if it weren't for me.

27:25.100 --> 27:26.960
I owe him a life.

27:27.580 --> 27:29.600
I once asked him

27:30.290 --> 27:34.320
why he chose to stay despite all the danger.

27:35.650 --> 27:37.440
He said

27:38.930 --> 27:41.440
he knew it's dangerous to stay

27:41.820 --> 27:44.010
and also thought about leaving.

27:45.290 --> 27:48.010
But Mr. Fan treats me sincerely

27:48.340 --> 27:50.170
like a friend.

27:52.220 --> 27:53.720
I chose to stay

27:55.010 --> 27:56.650
not to pay a debt of gratitude

27:57.700 --> 27:59.480
or protect him as my master.

28:04.340 --> 28:06.370
I've been treating you as my bosom friend

28:07.340 --> 28:09.680
although I've never told you.

28:10.130 --> 28:11.990
You're younger than me,

28:12.010 --> 28:13.770
so you're my younger brother.

28:19.580 --> 28:21.200
In this case,

28:21.930 --> 28:23.100
I'd never leave you alone

28:23.100 --> 28:24.410
in the capital city

28:24.500 --> 28:26.480
where you may encounter

28:26.650 --> 28:28.530
both open and covert attacks.

28:30.050 --> 28:31.440
I stay

28:33.010 --> 28:35.170
because I want to.

28:36.460 --> 28:38.530
I won't regret

28:38.700 --> 28:40.650
even if I have to undergo the most severe trials

28:42.770 --> 28:44.480
and lose my life.

28:45.930 --> 28:49.080
Fan Xian, take care of them

28:49.700 --> 28:51.680
for me.

29:22.010 --> 29:23.930
Mr. Fan,

29:26.410 --> 29:31.410
this is why he chose to stay.

29:31.980 --> 29:33.890
You owe him nothing.

29:34.740 --> 29:37.370
He chose to do it himself.

29:42.740 --> 29:44.440
Mrs. Teng, how about

29:44.460 --> 29:46.080
moving to the capital city with your son?

29:47.500 --> 29:49.080
From now on,

29:49.580 --> 29:50.990
I'll treat your son as mine.

29:51.010 --> 29:52.480
Don't bother.

29:54.050 --> 29:55.410
I see.

29:56.220 --> 29:59.560
You want to stay here.

30:00.380 --> 30:01.530
It's okay.

30:02.460 --> 30:03.910
I'll send guys to take care of you.

30:03.930 --> 30:05.290
I'll also visit you regularly.

30:05.530 --> 30:07.050
No, thank you.

30:08.650 --> 30:10.800
In the future,

30:12.650 --> 30:15.010
you'd better not come again.

30:16.460 --> 30:18.080
Mr. Fan,

30:20.010 --> 30:22.650
I know you're sincere,

30:23.500 --> 30:24.380
but I don't want to see

30:24.380 --> 30:26.370
anything happen

30:26.530 --> 30:28.370
to his only son

30:28.930 --> 30:31.440
someday.

30:32.860 --> 30:34.530
Mr. Fan,

30:34.890 --> 30:37.530
he died for you of his own will,

30:39.130 --> 30:41.440
but as a woman,

30:42.050 --> 30:44.170
I can't see those larger issues.

30:46.500 --> 30:52.370
He left us alone, so I can't help complaining.

30:54.410 --> 30:59.800
Please forgive me.

31:04.530 --> 31:06.170
I see.

31:12.580 --> 31:14.290
He promised to grow old with you,

31:15.770 --> 31:17.770
but he died before he kept his promise.

31:19.980 --> 31:22.410
I can understand

31:24.380 --> 31:26.170
even if you hate me to the core.

31:26.770 --> 31:28.010
So,

31:35.050 --> 31:39.720
I'm leaving.

33:18.530 --> 33:19.890
Wang Qinian.

33:20.890 --> 33:22.960
Your Excellency, I'm going to see you.

33:23.010 --> 33:24.680
I need you to do something for me.

33:25.250 --> 33:27.680
You must be well-connected in the capital city.

33:27.700 --> 33:29.530
Hire some people

33:29.740 --> 33:31.890
to take care of Teng Zijing's wife and son in secret.

33:32.250 --> 33:34.130
Don't let them know it's me that did it.

33:35.100 --> 33:37.010
Your Excellency, you can rely on me.

33:37.770 --> 33:39.150
Why do you want to see me?

33:39.170 --> 33:40.720
Did you find something out?

33:49.170 --> 33:50.580
I read a file in secret

33:50.580 --> 33:52.840
at the First Division.

33:52.890 --> 33:54.440
The two female assassinators

33:54.460 --> 33:55.600
are disciples or followers of

33:55.620 --> 33:57.930
Si Gujian in Dongyi Town.

33:58.250 --> 34:00.010
One of the Great Masters wants to kill me?

34:00.580 --> 34:02.480
Don't think too much.

34:02.500 --> 34:03.620
The Four Great Masters

34:03.620 --> 34:06.250
are extraordinary.

34:06.770 --> 34:09.410
Si Gujian once defended

34:09.580 --> 34:10.990
the whole town of Dongyi

34:11.010 --> 34:12.230
all alone.

34:12.250 --> 34:14.280
You can imagine how impressive he is.

34:14.340 --> 34:15.670
If he wanted to kill you,

34:15.690 --> 34:18.190
he wouldn't need to assassinate you.

34:18.210 --> 34:18.730
So,

34:18.730 --> 34:20.180
it's someone else

34:20.180 --> 34:22.450
behind the two assassinators.

34:23.100 --> 34:24.600
Who is it?

34:26.250 --> 34:28.080
It's hard to tell.

34:28.620 --> 34:30.800
They're dead

34:30.970 --> 34:32.930
and we don't know where they stayed.

34:33.210 --> 34:35.170
We don't have any clue.

34:35.450 --> 34:37.170
I know where they lived.

34:37.770 --> 34:39.160
How did you know that?

34:39.180 --> 34:40.510
Where did you see him?

34:40.530 --> 34:41.860
In a courtyard.

34:41.860 --> 34:42.580
At that time,

34:42.580 --> 34:44.640
he lived in a box.

34:44.660 --> 34:45.670
Do you remember

34:45.690 --> 34:47.170
where it is?

34:59.860 --> 35:01.650
They had a fight.

35:25.140 --> 35:27.230
The pattern looks familiar.

35:27.250 --> 35:28.730
Where did you see it?

35:28.970 --> 35:30.600
Let me think about it.

35:30.970 --> 35:31.880
Oh.

35:31.900 --> 35:33.420
One of our secret agents

35:33.420 --> 35:34.670
that lurk in Beiqi

35:34.690 --> 35:36.670
sent us a secret report,

35:36.690 --> 35:38.160
on which

35:38.180 --> 35:39.750
I saw the pattern.

35:39.770 --> 35:41.230
What does it mean?

35:41.250 --> 35:43.410
I didn't look at it carefully.

35:43.530 --> 35:44.100
Where is

35:44.100 --> 35:45.230
the secret report?

35:45.250 --> 35:47.160
I think it's in His Excellency Zhu's room.

35:47.180 --> 35:48.120
Zhu Ge.

35:48.140 --> 35:49.490
Right.

35:49.580 --> 35:52.410
But I don't think he'll show it to you.

35:52.490 --> 35:53.570
I'll steal it.

35:54.420 --> 35:56.270
Let me do it.

35:56.290 --> 35:57.660
I'm more familiar

35:57.660 --> 35:59.320
with the situation there.

36:00.530 --> 36:02.890
Do you know what will happen

36:03.100 --> 36:04.430
if you're caught?

36:04.450 --> 36:05.800
Your Excellency,

36:06.690 --> 36:07.970
I've already broken the rules

36:07.970 --> 36:10.030
by selling books and drawings.

36:10.050 --> 36:11.340
I also stole the information

36:11.340 --> 36:13.130
about the two assassinators.

36:13.210 --> 36:14.470
I'm an old hand

36:14.490 --> 36:16.890
at such things.

36:18.210 --> 36:19.100
I'll go with you.

36:19.100 --> 36:21.470
Your Excellency, I accept your kindness.

36:21.490 --> 36:23.000
Actually,

36:23.290 --> 36:25.580
the Investigator's Office is investigating

36:25.580 --> 36:28.040
the assassination attempt.

36:30.420 --> 36:32.560
What else do you want to tell me?

36:33.140 --> 36:34.530
When I looked for information

36:34.530 --> 36:36.230
about the two female assassinators,

36:36.250 --> 36:39.270
I found another clue in the file.

36:39.290 --> 36:41.560
The crossbows used by them

36:41.660 --> 36:43.190
belong to military supplies.

36:43.210 --> 36:44.660
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

36:44.660 --> 36:46.430
Um. I think

36:46.450 --> 36:48.640
it's a serious matter that secret agents of Beiqi

36:48.660 --> 36:49.710
collude with the military.

36:49.730 --> 36:51.250
I'm afraid you'll get into trouble

36:51.250 --> 36:52.050
if you're involved.

36:52.050 --> 36:53.880
But why did you tell me in the end?

36:53.900 --> 36:54.880
You said

36:54.900 --> 36:56.140
you want to steal that secret report

36:56.140 --> 36:57.160
from His Excellency Zhu.

36:57.180 --> 36:58.970
In this case, I have nothing to worry about.

36:59.970 --> 37:00.990
Now that they belong to military supplies,

37:01.010 --> 37:02.470
do you know where they're from?

37:02.490 --> 37:05.270
It's not mentioned in the file.

37:05.290 --> 37:06.160
The First Division

37:06.180 --> 37:07.840
must be investigating.

37:07.860 --> 37:09.840
So, they haven't got any clue.

37:11.820 --> 37:13.450
Actually,

37:13.490 --> 37:16.130
I know something about it.

37:18.010 --> 37:19.490
Go ahead.

37:20.420 --> 37:21.670
The Patrol Division

37:21.690 --> 37:22.690
lost a batch of bows and crossbows

37:22.690 --> 37:23.990
the other day.

37:24.010 --> 37:25.400
I think what the assassinators used

37:25.420 --> 37:27.600
must be part of them.

37:27.620 --> 37:29.970
How did you know that?

37:30.450 --> 37:34.950
The Investigator's Office is also
responsible for army inspections.

37:34.970 --> 37:36.190
The commander

37:36.210 --> 37:37.730
came to me that day

37:37.730 --> 37:40.560
and asked me to help him hide the truth.

37:40.580 --> 37:42.210
I did him a favor.

37:43.050 --> 37:44.990
So, you didn't report it.

37:45.010 --> 37:46.030
You charged him, right?

37:46.050 --> 37:47.650
Of course.

37:48.530 --> 37:50.270
To support family.

37:50.290 --> 37:52.360
You often did such things, right?

37:52.380 --> 37:53.750
Or he couldn't have come to you.

37:53.770 --> 37:55.990
I'm warm-hearted

37:56.010 --> 37:57.250
and righteous.

37:57.250 --> 37:57.940
It's true

37:57.940 --> 37:59.100
I've earned a good reputation.

37:59.100 --> 38:00.520
Stop bragging.

38:01.050 --> 38:02.270
Do you mean

38:02.290 --> 38:04.040
something has gone wrong with the commander?

38:05.690 --> 38:07.080
Your Excellency, how about this?

38:07.100 --> 38:08.880
I'll go back to the Investigator's Office

38:08.900 --> 38:10.470
to steal the report

38:10.490 --> 38:12.430
and see if I can find out its origin.

38:12.450 --> 38:14.580
You go to the commander's mansion

38:14.580 --> 38:16.750
to look for clues.

38:16.770 --> 38:18.240
Give me the address.

39:15.380 --> 39:16.970
That's it.

40:14.050 --> 40:15.840
Your Excellency.

40:18.100 --> 40:20.080
How will you explain it?

40:21.820 --> 40:23.320
Your Excellency.

40:23.420 --> 40:26.400
You've been working hard and
performing a valuable service.

40:26.420 --> 40:29.270
I admire you very much.

40:29.290 --> 40:31.640
I don't know what I should do

40:31.660 --> 40:33.080
to show my respect,

40:33.100 --> 40:37.080
so I went to clean your room.

40:37.580 --> 40:38.750
I mean that

40:38.770 --> 40:41.280
from the bottom of my heart.

40:42.380 --> 40:43.840
So,

40:43.860 --> 40:44.820
it's also you

40:44.820 --> 40:47.840
that looked up the information

40:47.860 --> 40:50.400
on the assassination attempt on Niulan Street.

40:50.420 --> 40:53.160
Your Excellency, you already knew that.

40:53.180 --> 40:54.050
Catch him!

40:54.050 --> 40:56.170
I must go!

40:59.380 --> 41:02.450
He's really a master of lightness skill.

41:02.770 --> 41:04.670
Dismiss Wang Qinian's rank.

41:04.690 --> 41:05.770
Hunt for him in the whole city.

41:05.770 --> 41:07.000
Yes, sir.

42:05.490 --> 42:06.950
I was found by His Excellency Zhu.

42:06.970 --> 42:09.120
The First Division is hunting for me.

42:09.140 --> 42:10.510
Alright. Don't panic.

42:10.530 --> 42:11.490
I've got a Director-General token.

42:11.490 --> 42:12.890
Nobody can take you away from me.

42:13.580 --> 42:15.080
What's going on here?

42:17.490 --> 42:19.270
Everyone here

42:19.290 --> 42:20.600
hanged themselves from a beam.

42:21.420 --> 42:23.000
Everyone?

42:23.580 --> 42:26.320
They all died.

42:27.580 --> 42:29.230
Something must be going wrong.

42:29.250 --> 42:31.840
If the commander committed suicide
because he colluded with the enemy,

42:31.860 --> 42:33.370
how about his servants?

42:33.450 --> 42:35.600
Why did they also do that?

42:36.050 --> 42:37.800
He just received visitors in the study,

42:37.820 --> 42:39.520
but they're gone.

42:40.420 --> 42:41.270
It's all my fault.

42:41.290 --> 42:42.030
If I had told you earlier

42:42.050 --> 42:43.890
about this matter,

42:43.940 --> 42:45.840
maybe they could've been saved.

42:45.860 --> 42:47.730
The same thing would happen even if you had.

42:48.010 --> 42:50.080
They want me to be here a little late.

42:50.100 --> 42:51.800
Just a little late.

42:51.820 --> 42:55.210
This is a warning. This is a threat.

43:18.240 --> 43:21.820
In the river of history,

43:21.840 --> 43:25.310
time goes round and round.

43:28.120 --> 43:31.460
Memories about the former and present lives

43:31.480 --> 43:35.550
join each other in an endless way.

43:37.440 --> 43:40.060
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:40.080 --> 43:42.320
one season follows another in a flash,

43:42.320 --> 43:44.820
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:44.840 --> 43:46.440
I just can't give up

43:46.440 --> 43:49.780
to be with you for my whole life.

43:49.800 --> 43:55.270
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:56.520 --> 43:59.070
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:59.360 --> 44:01.400
Year after year in the wandering,

44:01.400 --> 44:04.060
