44:08.560 --> 44:10.950
I never feel regretful.

44:11.000 --> 44:12.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:12.360 --> 44:15.340
I still miss you as ever.

44:15.360 --> 44:18.310
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:18.600 --> 44:20.660
With a gentle heart,

44:20.680 --> 44:23.340
